{
    "title": "NFL Rivals - Football Game",
    "description": "Dive into the newest season of NFL Rivals packed with fresh content and endless possibilities to elevate your game! Become the ultimate football general manager and dominate the gridiron in the hottest officially licensed NFL football digital card game. NFL Rivals blends captivating arcade-style gameplay with top NFL digital player cards, offering a sports game experience like no other. Experience more action, more strategy, and more excitement with new features and ways to play.\r\n\r\nShowcase your digital card collection skills in fast-paced football that brings a unique and fun twist to mobile sports games. Get game-day ready and score touchdowns with your favorite NFL players and teams.\r\n\r\nSet your football team, upgrade and trade, and gear up in Squads with other GMs. Whether it\u2019s the star quarterback, linebacker, or wide receiver, build your football team of star players to ignite your next rivalry in non-stop action. NFL football excitement awaits in this energetic sports card collecting game that will test your strategy and skill. Each game is action-packed with exhilarating arcade-style football gameplay and legendary digital card collection opportunities.\r\n\r\nFootball general manager or owner \u2013 the choice is yours. Build your own football team, call the plays, run the offense, and unlock brand new players as you compete in thrilling events. Test your football general manager skills and your team against others to earn in-game rewards in an exciting NFL manager experience. Compete in exciting asynchronous PVP football tournaments or join a squad with friends to climb the leaderboards.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n\r\nGame Updates\r\n- Revamped Game Hub, making it easier than ever to jump into new events and offers and stay informed about what\u2019s coming\r\n- Visual enhancements to the card art, stadium and animations for a more immersive experience\r\n- Synergy Collection system enables your team to level up using the cards you already own and gain extra power (PWR)\r\n- Crafting \u201crecipes\u201d help you put your cards to use and earn exclusive rewards upon completion\r\n\r\nBuild Your Dream Team\r\n- Unlock NFL players as you play, collect digital cards, and upgrade digital collectibles of your favorite stars\r\n- Buy, sell and trade digital player cards like never before in the marketplace to maximize your team\u2019s potential\r\n- Whether quarterback or wide receiver, build your All-Pro football team in each position to achieve NFL GM stardom\r\n\r\nJoin the Multiplayer Football Action\r\n- Participate in weekly multiplayer events and compete against other players in asynchronous mode\r\n- Climb to the top of the NFL GM leaderboards while earning in-game rewards\r\n\r\nExperience High-Octane, Arcade-Style Gameplay\r\n- Enjoy electrifying gameplay with incredible catches, fun visual effects, hilarious touchdown celebrations and big moments\r\n- Play with your favorite pro NFL players in high-speed, adrenaline-filled games\r\n- Kickoff the season, make the playoffs, and win the Super Bowl with your favorite NFL players\r\n\r\nJoin the digital league of the NFL now! Enter the stadium and tackle the competition today!\r\n\r\nFollow NFL Rivals on social media for the latest updates:\r\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/playnflrivals\r\nDiscord - https://discord.com/invite/nflrivals\r\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/playnflrivals/\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/nflrivals/\r\n\r\nNeed a hand? Contact support: \u202fhttps://support.rivals.game/hc/en-us\r\nNFL Rivals Terms of Use: https://nfl.rivals.game/terms-of-use\r\nNFL Rivals Privacy Policy: https://nfl.rivals.game/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nFollow NFL Rivals on social media for the latest updates:\r\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/playnflrivals\r\nDiscord - https://discord.com/invite/nflrivals\r\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/playnflrivals/\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/nflrivals/\r\n\r\nNeed a hand? Contact support: \u202fhttps://support.rivals.game/hc/en-us\r\nNFL Rivals Terms of Use: https://nfl.rivals.game/terms-of-use\r\nNFL Rivals Privacy Policy: https://nfl.rivals.game/privacy-policy",
